## 1. High-Level System Architecture

Project ANU consists of a React Web Portal, a Node.js/Express REST & WebSocket Backend, a Python Volume Conversion Worker, a PostgreSQL Database with PII Encryption, Object Storage, AWS IVS Realtime Streaming, and VR Headsets/Ultrasound Simulator Probes.

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph ClientLayer["Client & Device Layer"]
        WebClient["Web Browser Client (React.js SPA)<br/>Port 3000 / Nginx"]
        VRHeadset["VR Headset / Simulator Device<br/>(Oculus / Pico / Custom Probe)"]
    end

    subgraph GatewayLayer["API & Communication Gateway"]
        APIGateway["Express.js Server (Port 4004)<br/>REST API & Auth"]
        SocketIO["Socket.IO Service<br/>Realtime Activity Broadcasts"]
        IVSService["AWS IVS Real-Time Streaming<br/>Live Video & WebRTC Stages"]
    end

    subgraph ServiceLayer["Application Logic & Processing"]
        AuthService["Auth & Session Store<br/>(JWT, PII Decryption, Blind Index)"]
        ActivityTracker["Activity Tracking Middleware<br/>Central Event Logger"]
        CourseManager["Course & Batch Manager<br/>(Curriculum, Modules, Resources)"]
        IIVREngine["IIVR & MindSpark Engine<br/>(Type1, Type2, Annotations, Measurement)"]
        AnalyticsEngine["Analytics & Benchmarking Engine<br/>(Scores, Accuracy, Cohort Benchmarking)"]
        VolWorker["Python Vol-Conversion Worker<br/>(ConvertVolToNifti.py: .vol -> .nii)"]
    end

    subgraph DataLayer["Persistence & Storage Layer"]
        PostgresDB[("PostgreSQL Database (Supabase Pooler)<br/>Users, Batches, Sessions, Logs")]
        ObjectStorage[("Object Storage (Supabase / AWS S3)<br/>Volumes, NIfTI, Images, Recordings")]
    end

    WebClient -->|"HTTP / REST API"| APIGateway
