## 2. User Roles & RBAC Matrix

The system implements strict Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) enforced through the `Authenticate` middleware and controller models:

| Role Code | Role Name | Scope & Capabilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`99`** | **Super Admin** | System-wide authority, platform-wide course mappings, institutional oversight, global volume management |
| **`101`** | **Institution Admin** | Institutional batch creation, instructor/trainee onboarding, volume review & approval for institution |
| **`102`** | **Instructor** | Batch-specific oversight, volume upload (requires approval), live trainee supervision, performance reviews |
| **`103`** | **Trainee / Learner** | Course progression, interactive MindSpark modules, VR ultrasound simulations (P1-P4, T1-T2), dashboard |

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    SuperAdmin["Role 99: Super Admin"]
    InstAdmin["Role 101: Institution Admin"]
    Instructor["Role 102: Instructor"]
    Trainee["Role 103: Trainee"]

    SuperAdmin -->|"Manages Institutions, Global Settings & Global Mappings"| InstAdmin
    InstAdmin -->|"Creates Batches & Assigns Instructors"| Instructor
    InstAdmin -->|"Enrolls Trainees into Batches"| Trainee
    Instructor -->|"Supervises Sessions & Reviews Performance"| Trainee

    subgraph VolumeGovernance["Volume Governance Workflow"]
        InstructorUpload["Instructor Uploads Volume"] -->|"status: pending"| InstApproval{"Institution Admin Approval"}
        InstApproval -->|"Approved"| ReadyConvert["Ready for Conversion"]
        InstApproval -->|"Rejected"| RejectVolume["Rejected / Archived"]
        AdminUpload["Admin / Super Admin Upload"] -->|"status: approved (Auto)"| ReadyConvert
    end
```

