## 5. 3D Ultrasound Volume & Recording Pipeline

Project ANU utilizes real clinical 3D ultrasound volumes (GE Kretz `.vol`). These files undergo a multi-stage validation, approval, Python volumetric conversion, and calibration process before being mapped into VR training sessions.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    StartUpload([1. Instructor / Admin Uploads .vol File]) --> UploadEndpoint["POST /api/v1/sv-upload<br/>(Multipart Form: file, GA, Trimester, Presentation)"]
    UploadEndpoint --> StoreRaw["Store in Supabase/S3 Storage: volumes/{filename}"]
    
    StoreRaw --> RoleCheck{"Uploader Role?"}
    RoleCheck -->|"Role 99 / 101 (Admin)"| AutoApprove["Auto-Approve (status: true)"]
    RoleCheck -->|"Role 102 (Instructor)"| PendingApprove["Status: Pending Review (status: false)"]
    
    PendingApprove --> ReviewStep["PATCH /api/v1/approve-volume/:status/:volume_id"]
    ReviewStep --> ApprovalCheck{"Institution Admin Approval?"}
    ApprovalCheck -->|"Approved"| AutoApprove
    ApprovalCheck -->|"Rejected"| RejectedEnd([Volume Rejected])

    AutoApprove --> ConvertTrigger["2. Trigger Conversion: PUT /api/v1/convert-vol/:volume_id"]
    ConvertTrigger --> PyWorker["3. Python Vol-Conversion Worker<br/>(ConvertVolToNifti.py)"]
    
    subgraph PyConversionEngine["Python Conversion Process"]
        ReadVol["Parse GE Kretz Ultrasound Volume Header"] --> ExtractVoxel["Extract 3D Cartesian Voxel Array"]
        ExtractVoxel --> Resample["Voxel Resampling & Coordinate Transformation"]
        Resample --> WriteNii["Write NIfTI File (.nii / compressed .nii.gz)"]
    end
    
    PyWorker --> PyConversionEngine
    PyConversionEngine --> UploadNii["Upload NIfTI to Object Storage"]
    UploadNii --> UpdateDB["Update DB: conversion_status = 'completed'"]

    UpdateDB --> PlacementUpload["4. Volume Placement Calibration<br/>POST /api/v1/volume-placement (JSON Coordinate Space)"]
    PlacementUpload --> RecordingUpload["5. Expert Reference Upload<br/>POST /api/v1/uploadvolumerecording"]
    
    subgraph ExpertRecordings["Reference Assets"]
        ShadowRec["Shadow Recording (Expert Probe Trajectory & Plane Sweep)"]
        StepRec["Step Recording (Key Guidance Waypoints & Audio Prompts)"]
    end
    RecordingUpload --> ExpertRecordings

    ExpertRecordings --> CourseMapping["6. Course Mapping Form<br/>POST /api/v1/course-mappings"]
    CourseMapping --> MappingTuple["Link Volume + Trimester + Module + Unit (BPD/HC, AC, FL) + Course Type (P1-P4, T1-T2)"]
    MappingTuple --> ReadyForSimulation([Simulation Scenario Ready for VR Trainees])
```

