## 8. Evaluation, Analytics & "Action Engine" Flow

The platform's analytics architecture follows a three-tier design philosophy:
1. **Top → Insight** (Current state & readiness score)
2. **Middle → Diagnosis** (Competency breakdown, error rate, benchmark gap)
3. **Bottom → Action** (Prescribed remediation, abnormal cases, guided practice)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    RawData[("Raw Telemetry & Attempt Data<br/>test_attempts_logs, sessions, iivr_submissions")] --> AnalyticsEngine["Analytics Engine (AnalyticsModel.js)"]

    subgraph MetricsComputation["Metric Aggregation & Computation"]
        AnalyticsEngine --> CalcStreak["Practice Streak & Total Training Hours"]
        AnalyticsEngine --> CalcAccuracy["Accuracy Trend (Across Attempts 1..N)"]
        AnalyticsEngine --> CalcProbe["Probe Stability & Handling Benchmark Gap"]
        AnalyticsEngine --> CalcPlane["Plane Acquisition Accuracy (% Correct Planes)"]
        AnalyticsEngine --> CalcBiometry["Measurement Error Offset (Delta in mm vs Ground Truth)"]
        AnalyticsEngine --> CalcReattempts["Reattempt Count (P3, P4, T1, T2)"]
    end

    subgraph BenchmarkingCohort["Cohort & Expert Benchmarking"]
        CalcAccuracy --> CohortComp["Compare with Batch / Cohort Average"]
        CalcProbe --> ExpertComp["Compare with Expert Gold Benchmark (e.g. 90%)"]
        CalcBiometry --> PercentileRank["Compute Percentile Rank (e.g. Top 35%)"]
    end

    subgraph DashboardEngine["Trainee Dashboard Display Structure"]
        TopLevel["TOP LAYER: Immediate Insights<br/>- Overall Readiness Score (e.g. 74%)<br/>- Cohort Rank (e.g. Top 32%)<br/>- Weekly Progress (+6%)<br/>- Total Hours (e.g. 12h)"]
        
        MidLevel["MIDDLE LAYER: Diagnostic Breakdown<br/>- Skill Competencies: Probe Handling (🟡), Plane Acquisition (🟢), Biometry (🟡), Anatomy (🔴)<br/>- Accuracy vs Time Curve (4.2 min/task)<br/>- Error Rate (18%)<br/>- Last Session Offset (+2.3 mm)"]
        
        BottomLevel["BOTTOM LAYER: Prescriptive Action Engine<br/>- Identified Skill Gaps (e.g. Anatomy Identification @ 52%)<br/>- Recommended Action: Repeat Module 2 + Practice 3 Abnormal Cases<br/>- Probe Adjustment Cue: 'Adjust probe tilt slightly inferiorly'"]
    end

    CohortComp --> TopLevel
    ExpertComp --> MidLevel
    PercentileRank --> MidLevel
    MidLevel --> BottomLevel
```

