## Summary of Key Endpoints & Modules

| Module / Area | Key Routes | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Authentication** | `POST /api/v1/login`<br/>`POST /api/v1/refreshToken`<br/>`POST /api/v1/sessions` | Multi-device auth with PII decryption & blind lookup |
| **Volumetric Pipeline** | `POST /api/v1/sv-upload`<br/>`PUT /api/v1/convert-vol/:id`<br/>`POST /api/v1/volume-placement` | Raw 3D volume upload, approval, NIfTI conversion & calibration |
| **Recordings & Mapping** | `POST /api/v1/uploadvolumerecording`<br/>`POST /api/v1/course-mappings` | Expert trajectory recording upload & curriculum association |
| **Didactic (MindSpark)** | `POST /api/v1/submit-msob`<br/>`GET /api/v1/mindspark-questions` | Interactive didactic Q&A (MCQ, Matching, Crossword, etc.) |
| **VR Ultrasound (IIVR)**| `POST /api/v1/iivr-start-test`<br/>`POST /api/v1/iivr`<br/>`POST /api/v1/iivr-end-test` | Hands-on plane freeze, annotation, caliper biometry measurement |
| **Live Tele-Mentoring** | `POST /api/v1/streaming/sessions`<br/>`POST /api/v1/streaming/sessions/:id/join` | WebRTC ultrasound stream sharing between Trainee and Instructor |
| **Analytics Engine** | `GET /api/v1/user-stats`<br/>`GET /api/v1/skill-competency`<br/>`GET /api/v1/performance-metrics` | Multi-tier reporting: Accuracy, Probe Stability, Benchmarks |
